{
  "id": "chunking",
  "title": "Chunking and Indexing",
  "brief": "Your support bot answers from a 600-page policy handbook (about 420,000 tokens). It was indexed in 100-token chunks with no overlap, so rules and their exceptions often land in different chunks: the bot quotes the rule and drops the exception. Get at least 85% of answers right for under $0.025 per question by changing how the handbook is chunked.",
